{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, fix stale-request updates, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state. I added a per-search ID, including for empty queries, so only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. I’ll run the existing tests and a focused race-condition check, since the tests don’t cover overlapping requests.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a per-search ID. Stale requests can no longer update results, loading, or errors. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; the race-condition probe and git diff --check passed. All exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a per-search ID. Stale requests can no longer update results, loading, or errors. Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; the race-condition probe and git diff --check passed. All exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":11,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-iincv9nu/search-3-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":193,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-92a74450f61e02ba785a17258b969162.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nsuite_status=$?\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nfor (const clear of [false, true]) {\n  for (const fail of [false, true]) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('current');\n    if (clear) await c.search('  ');\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    if (fail) requests[0].reject(new Error('stale error'));\n    else requests[0].resolve([{ id: 'old', title: 'Old', url: '/old' }]);\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    const items = [{ id: 'current', title: 'Current', url: '/current' }];\n    requests[1].resolve(items);\n    await current;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), clear\n      ? { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null }\n      : { query: 'current', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('Race-condition probe passed');\nNODE\nprobe_status=$?\ngit diff --check\n diff_status=$?\ngit diff --stat\ngit diff -- src/search/controller.ts\nprintf '\\nVerification exit codes: tests=%s probe=%s diff-check=%s\\n' \"$suite_status\" \"$probe_status\" \"$diff_status\"\nexit $((suite_status || probe_status || diff_status))","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-iincv9nu/search-3-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":366,"stdout_bytes":2295,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-adda00c6f766a1aae4e75d7a829a8f10.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":43140,"output_tokens":1048},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":14592,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":11}}
